title: Operation Reversed Scale
subtitle: The preparations are in order, we just need the approval
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: 1
view-if: {! dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.qualities[dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.qualities.plotMap[dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.qualities.plot_target]] >= 100 !}
on-arrival: operations_scene = 0; {!

if (plot_target == "hjalmar") {
    Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap = 0.55
    Q.prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap = 0.50
    Q.rb_dissent_plot_cap = 0;
}
if (plot_target == "bruning") {
    Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap = 0.65
    Q.prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap = 0.70
    Q.rb_dissent_plot_cap = 10;
}
if (plot_target == "rohm") {
    Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap = 0.55
    Q.prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap = 0.50
    Q.rb_dissent_plot_cap = 0;
}
if (plot_target == "leow") {
    Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap = 0.45
    Q.prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap = 0.40
    Q.rb_dissent_plot_cap = 50;
}
!}

= Plots and preparations

Partners: [+ assassination_partners_string +]

It's too late to turn back now...

These are our current estimates of loyalty within the police, if any of the 2 are disloyal it *will* lead to disaster. 

[? if assassination_partners == "Police" or assassination_partners == "Prussian" or assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner" : Current interior police loyalty: [+ interior_police_loyalty : loyalty +]. [? if interior_police_loyalty < 0.55: The police show frighteningly low levels of loyalty. ?] ?]

[? if assassination_partners == "Prussian" or assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner" : Current prussian police loyalty: [+ prussian_police_loyalty : loyalty +]. [? if prussian_police_loyalty < 0.5: The Prussian police seem untrustworthy. ?] ?]

[? if assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner" : Current Reichsbanner dissent: [+ prussian_police_loyalty : loyalty +]. [? if rb_dissent >= 50: The Reichsbanner seem unwilling. ?] ?]

- @go: Operation Reversed Scale is given the go ahead.
- @bribe: For extra measure.

@go
subtitle: Operation Reversed Scale is given the go ahead. [? if chancellor == "Braun": "Who made that mess?" Braun, are you ok? "Sorry, must've been the wind" ?].
on-arrival: {!

if (Q.interior_police_loyalty >= Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.assassination_partners == "Police" ) {
    Q[plotMap[plot_target]] = "successful";
} else {
    Q[plotMap[plot_target]] = "failed";
}

if (Q.interior_police_loyalty >= Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.prussian_police_loyalty >= Q.prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.assassination_partners == "Prussian" ) {
    Q[plotMap[plot_target]] = "successful";
} else {
    Q[plotMap[plot_target]] = "failed";
}

if (Q.interior_police_loyalty >= Q.interior_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.prussian_police_loyalty >= Q.prussian_police_loyalty_plot_cap && Q.rb_dissent < Q,rb_dissent_plot_cap && Q.assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner" ) {
    Q[plotMap[plot_target]] = "successful";
} else {
    Q[plotMap[plot_target]] = "failed";
}

!}

@bribe
subtitle: -1 budget. Promise a pay raise well after the assisnation attempt.
choose-if: budget > 0
on-arrival: interior_police_loyalty *= 1.5; prussian_police_loyalty *= 1.5; budget -=1; hjalmar_plot = "successful" if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.55 and assassination_partners == "Police"; hjalmar_plot = "failed" if interior_police_loyalty < 0.55 and assassination_partners == "Police"; hjalmar_plot = "successful" if (interior_police_loyalty < 0.55 or prussian_police_loyalty < 0.5) and assassination_partners == "Prussian"; hjalmar_plot = "failed" if interior_police_loyalty < 0.55 and prussian_police_loyalty < 0.5 and assassination_partners == "Prussian"; hjalmar_plot = "successful" if interior_police_loyalty >= 0.55 and assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner"; hjalmar_plot = "failed" if interior_police_loyalty < 0.55 and assassination_partners == "Reichsbanner"; hjalmar_plot = "failed" if interior_police_loyalty < 0.55 and assassination_partners == "Spies"; hjalmar_plot = "successful" if assassination_partners == "Spies"; barmat +=1